 the Question 1 with the corresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nYesterday, right before my exam, I realized I didn't bring any pens to take the exam. I asked my friend Kevin if I could borrow one of his. He gave me a pen and told me I could keep it after the exam since he had many. When I returned home after the exam, I realized I had lost Kevin's pen. I looked everywhere, but couldn't find it. When I met Kevin today, I asked him how much he paid for it so I could give him the money.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would I ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Sentimental\nB) Embarrassment\nC) Guilt\nD) Delight\nE) Remorse\nF) Jealousy\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would I feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) I lost the pen I borrowed from Kevin\nB) Kevin rejected my offer to buy him a pen\nC) I failed my exam because I didn't bring a pen\nD) Kevin has way more pens than me","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.007575015604682482,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a0b79aa9dc5a833d8da8","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482359347,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:19:19","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"420bc0936ab74f559045a5ff026f51c8"}